      "Title": "Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Adapters.AdapterAction",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Adapters.AdapterAction.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Controls what happens to an individual item during adaptation.\nReturned from BeforeAdapt hooks.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
