    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.CoreFieldsEntityBase.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.CoreFieldsEntityBase.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.CoreFieldsEntityBase",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.CoreFieldsEntityBase.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Entity base class with audit fields (CreatedBy, CreatedDate,\nLastModifiedBy, LastModifiedDate) and optimistic concurrency\nvia a [Timestamp] column.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.CoreFieldsEntityBase.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"5\">Column ordering places audit fields after the entity's own columns\nso they sort to the end of the table in the database.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.DependentEntityCollection-1.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.DependentEntityCollection-1.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.DependentEntityCollection<T>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.DependentEntityCollection-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Manages the save/delete lifecycle for a collection of child entities.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.DependentEntityCollection-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"3\">Before SaveChanges: any item with IsMarkedForDelete == true is removed\nfrom the DbSet so EF Core will delete it from the database.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.DependentEntityCollection-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"6\">After SaveChanges: items marked for delete are pruned from the\nin-memory collection so the parent entity's navigation property\nreflects the current state.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.EntityBase.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.EntityBase.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.EntityBase",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.EntityBase.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Base class for EF Core entities. Implements the shared\nIEntityIdentity and IDeleteable interfaces from Benday.Common.Interfaces.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.EntityBase.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\">IsMarkedForDelete is [NotMapped] — it only exists in memory to signal\nthe DependentEntityCollection to remove this item during save.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.IDependentEntityCollection.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.IDependentEntityCollection.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.IDependentEntityCollection",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.IDependentEntityCollection.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Manages the lifecycle of dependent/child entities during save operations.\nBefore save: removes items marked for delete from the DbSet.\nAfter save: prunes the in-memory collection.</p>\n"
    },
