      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.Entities.IEntityWithDependents.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Interface for entities that manage dependent/child entity collections.\nThis is the aggregate root pattern — the parent entity controls the\nlifecycle of its children during save and delete operations.</p>\n"
