      "Title": "Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.ServiceLayers.IUsernameProvider",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.ServiceLayers.IUsernameProvider.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Provides the current username for audit field population.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.ServiceLayers.IUsernameProvider.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"3\">In production, this is typically backed by HttpContext.User.\nIn tests, it's a fake that returns a predictable value.\nThis is why it's an interface — so your service layer never\ntouches HttpContext directly.</p>\n"
    },
