      "Title": "Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.ServiceLayers.ServiceLayerBase<TModel, TEntity>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.ServiceLayers.ServiceLayerBase-2.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Base service layer. Handles the core flow:\nvalidate → get or create entity → adapt → save → copy back IDs.</p>\n<p sourcefile=\"api/Benday.EfCore.SqlServer.ServiceLayers.ServiceLayerBase-2.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"4\">The service owns the adapter. The repository only deals in entities.\nThe controller/API layer only deals in domain models. The service\nis the bridge.</p>\n"
